      "reasons": [
        "The definition’s first sentence (“total response expected by adding together the effects produced by two stimulations when each is given separately”) is not explicitly stated in the packet; the packet only describes that combined stimulation facilitated MEPs significantly more than the “algebraic summation of responses induced separately” without defining it as an “added together effects” total.",
